      <article class="reason reveal">
        <div class="num">8</div>
        <h2>Built so your baby can actually use it, not just so it sounds safer</h2>
        <p>A bottle only works if the baby accepts it. That is why the nipple feel, flow comfort, grip and cleaning experience matter. Hosfu is positioned as a practical daily bottle: soft silicone latch, clear glass milk chamber, easy cleaning and a premium feel parents can trust during tired 3am feeds.</p>
