      <article class="reason reveal">
        <div class="num">9</div>
        <h2>The honest part: it is not the cheapest option</h2>
        <p>Cheap plastic is cheap for a reason. Borosilicate glass, silicone and better heat-resistant materials cost more &mdash; and that is the point. Hosfu is for parents who would rather buy based on material quality than keep replacing cloudy, scratched or questionable bottles.</p>
        <p>No bottle can remove every worry from early parenthood. But choosing what touches your baby&rsquo;s milk is one decision you can make deliberately.</p>
