      <details>
        <summary>Is BPA-free plastic already safe enough?</summary>
        <p>BPA-free removes one specific chemical, which is good. But the bottle may still be polypropylene plastic, and the microplastic research is about physical particle release during heating and preparation &mdash; not BPA specifically.</p>
