      <details>
        <summary>Does this mean plastic bottles are dangerous?</summary>
        <p>No. This page does not claim that plastic bottles cause a specific disease or that every plastic bottle is unsafe. The honest point is that microplastic release has been measured, the health question is still being studied, and many parents prefer to reduce avoidable plastic contact where they can.</p>
